(defrule
    (false)
=>
    (chat-to-all "-----------GLOBAL----------")
)

(defrule
    (taunt-detected my-player-number 7)
=>
    (acknowledge-taunt my-player-number 7)
    (up-cc-send-cheat "marco")
    (up-cc-send-cheat "polo")
)

;Shadow, a an AOE2 AI by FireBall37
;I want to thank everyone in the AIscripters community. I have learned much from resources and discussions (and your ai's).
;Special thanks to LeifEricson for being so helpful and to Esty for his work arranging so many tournaments.
;Also, thanks to my brother for inspiring me and providing a worthy opponent when testing Shadow <3
;There may be some unused code lying around from earlier experiments. Ignore it if you can 11
;Enjoy! :)
;TAUNTS
;	131: Forces a krush (any player)
;	22: Chats current target player (any player)
;	250: Chats strategy (any player)
;###################### SUPPORTED SETTINGS
;Basically, standard settings, except plays only with Vikings
;Civ: VIKINGS ONLY!!!!!!
;Difficulty: Hard
;Game version: AoC UP 1.6+
;Number of players: 1v1
;Map size: Tiny
;Map type: Arabia
;Victory Conditions: Standard/Conquest
;Game-type: Random Map
;Map style: Standard
;Population: 200
;Starting age: Standard
;Starting resources: Standard
;Teams locked: Yes
;Diplomacy locked: Yes
